  {
    "speaker": "アイドル４",
    "text": "本当にありがとうございました……！\r\n私のせいでご迷惑をおかけしました……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003014040010,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "いえいえー！　お仕事は仕方ないです！\r\nそれにほんと、たまたま動きがわかってたってだけで……！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "1040030080",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200301404/2003014040010"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003014040020,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "スタッフさん用の動き確認くらいしかできなくて、\r\n逆に申し訳なかったです……！",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301404/2003014040020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "アイドル１",
    "text": "そんなことないですよ！！\r\n八宮さんのダンスすごかったです！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "アイドル２",
    "text": "ねー！　普段ならこんなこと絶対経験できないから\r\n一緒に踊れて楽しかったし！",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "アイドル２",
    "text": "うちのメンバーになってほしいくらい！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003014040030,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "そんなに！？　ですか！？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301404/2003014040030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "アイドル１",
    "text": "そんなにです！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "アイドル４",
    "text": "えっ！　てことは、\r\n私の代わりに八宮さんが加入……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "speaker": "アイドル４",
    "text": "私、ソロデビュー……！？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "アイドル２",
    "text": "ポジティブだねぇ！？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "アイドル３",
    "text": "違うから！　増員ってことだよ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003014040040,
