  {
    "id": 2003014040070,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "プロデューサー……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200301404/2003014040070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あ、ああ\r\nうん、ごめん",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "めぐるってかっこいいよなと思ってさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003014040080,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "……っええー？　なぁに、急にー！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301404/2003014040080"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003014040090,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "そんな突然褒められると照れちゃう！",
    "charAnim1": "touch",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301404/2003014040090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや……\r\n今なんとなく、昨日のめぐるを思い出して",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003014040100,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "昨日……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301404/2003014040100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003014040110,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "あっ、リハで代理したこと？\r\nイルミネのリハはいつも通りだったもんね……？",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301404/2003014040110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それと、その後の話だな\r\n今朝仲良くなってただろ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あっという間だったなと思って",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003014040120,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "ふふふっ",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301404/2003014040120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003014040130,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "みんなが仲良くしてくれたおかげで\r\nわたしが特別頑張ったわけじゃないよ？",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301404/2003014040130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "じゃあ、めぐるもみんなもかっこよかった、かな？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003014040140,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "……えへへっ",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301404/2003014040140"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003014040150,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "やっぱり、一緒に何かをやると\r\n一気に距離が縮まるなぁって思ったんだ",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301404/2003014040150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003014040160,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "動画見てひとりで踊ってた時は、ずっと一方通行で",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301404/2003014040160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003014040170,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "同じアイドルだけどちょっと遠かったの",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301404/2003014040170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003014040180,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "でも、今は……\r\nなんていうか……ちょっと仲間みたいな気持ち！",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301404/2003014040180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003014040190,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "２８３のみんなみたいな！",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301404/2003014040190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか……！　そうだよな\r\nリハとはいえ一緒に踊り切ったんだもんな",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003014040200,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "うん！",
